  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction</strong>: HAIL makes the headband made from sunglasses frames.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Ever wear your glasses on your head and notice that your hair looks kind of .. nice?? That's what HAIL does. We help you have a good hair day, everyday, with the only foldable headband that lifts like sunglasses. A Were on a mission to incite more confidence in women. Our medium is hair.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We believe in high quality, long lasting products. Every Hailband is spun sustainably from 100% Italian acetate, with strong 5 barrel hinges, and an 18K gold logo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Product description:&nbsp;</strong>The first foldable headband designed to be worn like sunglasses. Slip it out of its carrying case and immediately feel a sense of confidence.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Foldable</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Pain free</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Strong hold</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Fits (almost) everyone</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Comes boxes with a case and cleaning cloth</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Made from 100% Italian acetate, from the same supplier as LVMH sunglasses. Strong 5 barrel hinge, and 18K gold logo</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">A perfect gift</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">20% Commission</p>",
